{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38971","headline":"登石壁禅师水阁有作 · 杜荀鹤","name":"登石壁禅师水阁有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石壁早闻僧说好，今来偏与我相宜。\n有山有水堪吟处，无雨无风见景时。\n渔父晚船分浦钓，牧童寒笛倚牛吹。\n画人画得从他画，六幅应输八句诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}